+
+#### 🔧 Logg Prep (Trim/Uniform)
+Checkboxes for alle prep steps:
+- Trimmed (med lengde)
+- Chamfered
+- Deburred
+- Primer pocket uniformed
+- Flash hole deburred
+- Neck turned (med final thickness)
+- Weight sorted
+
+**Auto-functions:**
