+- Update `trim_length_mm`
+- Update flags
+
+#### 📏 Legg til Måling
+Logg dimensjoner:
+- Measurement type (new/fired/sized/after_trim)
+- Case length
+- Neck diameter
+- Neck thickness
+- Base diameter
+- Shoulder diameter
+- Weight
+- Concentricity (TIR)
+
+**Bruk:**
