+            <li><b>Large Rifle:</b> .308, 6.5 CM, .30-06, magnums</li>
+            <li><b>Standard:</b> General purpose, works with most powders</li>
+            <li><b>Magnum:</b> For slow powders, cold weather, big cases</li>
